  [1mThe fork:[0m whether [38;5;153m...[39m counts against [38;5;153mmaxLength[39m, or is added on top of it.
  - [1mEllipsis inside the budget[0m — output is [3mnever[0m longer than [38;5;153mmaxLength[39m. Callers can rely on the result fitting a
